# Local secrets example (do not commit real secrets)

# Copy this file to `local_secrets.tin` and fill in your real passwords.

#VARIABLE {mutiny_password} {your_mutiny_password_here}
#VARIABLE {haenym_password} {your_haenym_password_here}

